# Not ours to publish (the repo is public): the songs, the user's own tracks (hold, celebration, interval,
# stingers) and the album covers stay on the laptops; the cloud media sync copies them between laptops.
# Only the sound effects and the README are committed.
/media/*
!/media/fx/
!/media/README.md
# Made by tools/prep (npm run prep in apps/show): the analysis, stems, Hold and Interval data, and the decoded audio.
/out/
/cache/
# The laptop's cloud link folder (apps/cloud, npm run link): the Game plan, the journal copy, the manual resume.
/link/
# Never ours to publish, wherever a pool keeps it.
spotify_features.json
